[["text","OOP / LESSON 18 OF 45"],["heading","18. final Keyword"],["text","English: A final variable can be assigned only once; a final method cannot be overridden; a"],["text","final class cannot be extended."],["sinhala","","සිංහල: final variable එක නැවෙත assign කරන්න බැහැ. final method එක override කරන්නත්",461],["sinhala","","final class එක extend කරන්නත් බැහැ.",195],["heading","final variable → fixed binding; final method → no override; final class → no subclass"],["heading","Java example"],["code","final class Constants {"],["code","  static final int MAX = 100;"],["code","}"],["code","class Parent {"],["code","  final void show() {}"],["code","}"],["code","// Inside main: final reference, mutable object"],["code","final java.util.List<String> names = new java.util.ArrayList<>();"],["code","names.add(\"Kamal\"); // allowed"],["text","Interview question: Does final make an object immutable?"],["text","Answer: No. It prevents reference reassignment, not mutation of the object."],["text","Remember: final variable → fixed binding; final method → no override; final class → no"],["text","subclass"]]